  "instructions": [
    "Heat the vegetable oil in a skillet until shimmering.",
    "Add the diced onion and red bell pepper and sauté until translucent.",
    "Stir in the minced garlic and cook for 30 seconds.",
    "Add the day‑old rice, breaking up any clumps with a spoon.",
    "Season with ground marjoram, soy sauce, sesame oil, lime juice, and chili flakes.",
    "Cook, stirring frequently, until the rice is heated through and begins to crisp at the edges, about 5 minutes.",
    "Fold in the chopped scallions and remove from heat.",
    "Transfer the fried rice into a warmed agave leaf, tightly packing it into a tight cone.",
    "Fold the leaf into a paper‑towel wrapped pouch and let it steam for 2 minutes before serving."
